  "plan": "Write a script that: for each occupied cell, crops to the mask bounding box and resizes to 32x32 (translation/scale invariant), computes pairwise Hamming distance, greedily clusters, and prints one high-res 40-row ASCII representative per cluster along with the member cells and their colors. Then I'll identify each cluster's piece type and color.",
